                                                                            <td><p align="justify">Dr. V. V. Subrahmanyam is a distinguished academician and Professor of Computer Science, currently serving as the Director of the Planning and Development Division (P&DD) at Indira Gandhi National Open University (IGNOU), New Delhi. He has previously held several key academic and administrative positions including Director, School of Computer and Information Sciences (SOCIS) (May 2018 – May 2021), and Director, Centre for Online Education (COE) (May 2021 – Jan 2022). He was also a Member of IGNOU’s Board of Management (May 2020 – May 2021), Research Council Standing Committee, Institution’s Innovation Council, and Academic Council. He is an Editorial Board Member of the <i>American Journal of Computer Science and Technology</i> and was nominated as a Member of the Asian Council of Science Editors (from September 2023 onwards). He holds two published patents and was honoured with the IRDP Award for “Teaching and Research Excellence” in 2018.</p>
<p align="justify">An active contributor to online education, he has been offering the SWAYAM course <i>Database and Content Organization</i>since 2017 and serves as a Subject Matter Expert (SME) for four additional MOOCs on the platform. With over 26 years of teaching and research experience, he has published more than 60 papers in reputed international journals, conferences, and edited volumes. Under his guidance, three scholars have been awarded Ph.D. degrees in Computer Science, and he continues to supervise several others.</p>
<p align="justify">Dr. Subrahmanyam is a Life Member of professional bodies including ISTE, the Computer Society of India (CSI), and ICEIT. He has significantly contributed to curriculum development for undergraduate and postgraduate Computer Science programs across various universities. He is actively engaged as a technical committee member, program committee member, and reviewer for numerous national and international conferences and journals.</p>
<p align="justify">He has delivered keynote addresses, chaired sessions at various academic forums, and served as a resource person in faculty development programmes, webinars, training workshops, and seminars. He was Co-Principal Investigator for the e-content development project under the National Mission on Education through ICT (NMEICT), MHRD, Government of India, and served as Channel Coordinator for SWAYAMPRABHA Channel-19 (2020–2021).</p>
<p align="justify">Dr. Subrahmanyam has presented research papers at international conferences in Vietnam and Hong Kong and continues to review research papers for prestigious journals including InderScience (IJAISC), DESIDOC (DRDO Journal), Taylor & Francis, Thomson Reuters, IJOL, PLOS Journals, and <i>Annals of Library and Information Studies</i> (CSIR).</p>
</td>
